{title: Ja Tujhko Kabhi Pyar Na Mile}
{artist: Deepak Rathore Project}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Tune toda dil mera,        oh [Gm]saajna ki main
Sabse [A#]chupti rahi,        Ja ke [Gm]panghat pe main
khadi [F]roti [A#]rahi,        Shaam [A#]dhal thi chuki,
aankhein [Gm]nam thi meri,        Yaadein [A#]chubhti rahi,
sabse [Gm]chupti rahi,        Ja ke [A#]panghat pe main
main to [F]roti [A#]rahi,        Ki koi [A#]aata tha mujhko
[Gm]manaane kabhi,        Aaja [A#]aaya nahi,
chup [Gm]karaya nahi,        gale [A#]lagaya nahi
Sabse [Gm]chupti rahi,        Ja ke [A#]panghat pe main,
main to [F]roti [A#]rahi,        Tu na [A#]tadpa hai aise,
Tu bhi [Gm]tadpega aise,        ab [F]dua hai [A#]meri
Ja [A#]tujhko koi [Gm]pyaar na kare,        Ja [F]tujhko bhi kabhi [A#]pyaar na mile
Tu toh [A#]aisa na tha,        kabhi [Gm]aisa na kiya
Phir [A#]aisa kya hua tujhe,        [Gm]meri hi ab [F]nazar hai [A#]lagi
Ki kabhi [A#]barsa na aise,        Savan [Gm]barsega aise,
jaise [F]aankhein [A#]meri,        Ja [A#]tujhko koi [F]pyaar na [A#]kare
Ja [A#]tujhko bhi kabhi [F]pyaar na [A#]mile,        [A#]Saajna,tu toh [Gm]aaya nahi,
chup [A#]karaya nahi,        Sabse [Gm]chupti rahi,
Jaa ke [A#]panghat pe main,        khadi [F]roti [A#]rahi
[A#]Zamaana tha bura,        [A#]Zamaana tha bura koi [Gm]samjha nahi
Sabse [A#]sunti rahi,        chhod [Gm]apni hi gali
Main toh [F]roti [A#]rahi,        Ki kabhi [A#]toota na aise,
Woh dil bhi [Gm]tootega aise,        jaise [F]duniya [A#]meri
Ke tu aata tha mujhko manaane kabhi,        Ja [A#]tujhko koi [F]pyaar na [A#]kare
Ja [A#]tujhko bhi kabhi,        [F]pyaar na [A#]mile
